<li><span class="num">01</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f1">The moment after a printer is added is left to the model, and it changed every run</a></li><li><span class="num">02</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f2">The connection card can appear before there is anything to connect to</a></li><li><span class="num">03</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f3">Thirty seconds of silence, then a dead end</a></li><li><span class="num">04</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f4">Home says the printer “Sends files over Wi-Fi” right after the connection failed</a></li><li><span class="num">05</span><span class="sev sev-medium">Medium</span><a href="#f5">Ambiguous matches show three identical cards and then repeat them as chips</a></li><li><span class="num">06</span><span class="sev sev-medium">Medium</span><a href="#f6">A raw profile id leaks into the candidate list</a></li><li><span class="num">07</span><span class="sev sev-medium">Medium</span><a href="#f7">The Change conversation opens blind</a></li><li><span class="num">08</span><span class="sev sev-medium">Medium</span><a href="#f8">Connect-only opener forgets the address that just failed</a></li><li><span class="num">09</span><span class="sev sev-low">Low</span><a href="#f9">The panel's overflow menu wraps both labels and ignores Escape</a></li><li><span class="num">10</span><span class="sev sev-low">Low</span><a href="#f10">Chips could not be reached from the keyboard, and show no focus state</a></li><li><span class="num">11</span><span class="sev sev-low">Low</span><a href="#f11">The Photo button opens a generic file picker</a></li><li><span class="num">12</span><span class="sev sev-low">Low</span><a href="#f12">Adding a printer marks the project as unsaved</a></li><li><span class="num">13</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f13">There is no clear way out of the setup flow</a></li><li><span class="num">14</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><a href="#f14">A printer added by mistake cannot be undone from the conversation</a></li>
